cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the accompanying manuscript and the archived repository."
title: "ERA5-Philippines Solar Forecasting"
abstract: >
  A leakage-audited machine learning pipeline for ERA5-based
  solar forecasting across four Philippine cities (Muntinlupa,
  Baguio, Cebu, Davao). Forecasts surface solar radiation
  (ssrd_wm2) using publicly available ERA5 reanalysis data and
  evaluates compliance with the Philippine WESM 18% MAPE
  benchmark.
authors:
